::SPEECH_U05_L03_GuidedPractice_Q01::
Question ID: SPEECH_U05_L03_GuidedPractice_Q01
MLA Standard: MLA.SPEECH.COM.05
Question:
Which revision uses academic vocabulary clearly?
{
~A. Use a difficult word without explaining it#This choice is too vague or informal for the speech purpose. Choose language that supports audience understanding.
=B. Rehearsal improves delivery because the speaker can adjust pacing and volume#Correct. This choice uses vocabulary knowledge to make the speech clearer, more precise, and appropriate for the audience.
~C. Use a word that does not fit the audience#This choice reflects a misconception about word meaning or word origin. Use context and meaning to revise.
~D. Replace clear language with confusing language#This choice weakens the speech because it does not make the speaker language clearer or more precise.
}
::SPEECH_U05_L03_GuidedPractice_Q02::
